MuPDF command-line tool (mutool)
--------------------------------

Website: https://mupdf.com/
Bundled version: 1.28.6
Upstream license: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later
Copyright: Copyright (C) Artifex Software, Inc.

Proofreading renders PDF page images by running the unmodified ``mutool``
program as a separate process.  SciRetriever does not link MuPDF into its own
code, so the AGPL applies to the bundled ``mutool`` binary and not to
SciRetriever's MIT-licensed source.

``pnpm vendor:mupdf`` (scripts/vendor/build-mupdf.mjs) builds the binary from
the official, unmodified source release, verified by SHA-256 before building:

  https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/mupdf-downloads/releases/download/1.28.6/mupdf-1.28.6-source.tar.gz
  sha256 dc85000640a45d90ca9b77b061f6ca67cce0c4d4fbecf8819647baf573eef101

Every bundle (build/vendor/mupdf/linux-x64, or runtime/mupdf in a portable
package) carries the AGPL text as COPYING and a manifest.json naming that
source archive, its digest and the exact build options.  Together with the
build script they form the Corresponding Source of the distributed binary.
Anyone who receives the binary may obtain that source from the address above.
